- A source object is removed or regenerated.

Closing a collaboration workspace must not accidentally delete the source architectural project.

Deleting a participant's membership must not automatically erase the entire shared project.

Respect the existing product retention and user-data model.

If a cleanup job or scheduled expiry mechanism is required, implement it only through an available supported backend pattern. Do not claim server-side expiry based solely on a browser timer.

Preserve useful author and timestamp metadata for shared review records as supported by the privacy policy and existing application conventions.

